(7660769, 1248328, 96815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and great idea on the low perspective tile reflection. One very minor nitpick if I have to say something is that slightly missing the centre alignment gets exacerbated with so many reference points... I didn''t down vote for that, don''t worry! My top 3.</td>', 'Beautiful photo and great idea on the low perspective tile reflection. One very minor nitpick if I have to say something is that slightly missing the centre alignment gets exacerbated with so many reference points... I didn''t down vote for that, don''t worry! My top 3.', '2020-04-29 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660771, 1248533, 96815, '<td valign="top">Great idea for composition - framing and leading lines. If you were able to get some drama in the sky that would really seal the deal for me. This is a fantastic shot but we''ve got some stiff competition in this round! I''ll guess top 10!</td>', 'Great idea for composition - framing and leading lines. If you were able to get some drama in the sky that would really seal the deal for me. This is a fantastic shot but we''ve got some stiff competition in this round! I''ll guess top 10!', '2020-04-29 20:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660772, 1248322, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and colours overall. The dark mass protruding from the pond weighs a bit too heavy for me as it lacks detail to add value.</td>', 'Nice contrast and colours overall. The dark mass protruding from the pond weighs a bit too heavy for me as it lacks detail to add value.', '2020-04-29 20:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
