(7660775, 1248280, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel colours and unusual scene.</td>', 'Nice pastel colours and unusual scene.', '2020-04-29 20:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660776, 1248500, 96815, '<td valign="top">Great colours, depth, and composition. It''s top 5 for me!</td>', 'Great colours, depth, and composition. It''s top 5 for me!', '2020-04-29 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660777, 1248568, 96815, '<td valign="top">Wow, two entries of this beautiful scene!<br/> <br/>Great depth and dramatic sky. I think I would have cropped a touch off the right side as the house and tree have similar weight and share the focal point of the photo. This winds up throwing off the ''rule of thirds'' balance for me.</td>', 'Wow, two entries of this beautiful scene! Great depth and dramatic sky. I think I would have cropped a touch off the right side as the house and tree have similar weight and share the focal point of the photo. This winds up throwing off the ''rule of thirds'' balance for me.', '2020-04-29 21:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660778, 1248594, 96815, '<td valign="top">Quite the breathtaking scene and nicely processed. The bold border is a bit dated in my opinion, but it''s still subtle.</td>', 'Quite the breathtaking scene and nicely processed. The bold border is a bit dated in my opinion, but it''s still subtle.', '2020-04-29 21:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660779, 1248540, 96815, '<td valign="top">Ah, an infamous subject! Great job on the execution and composition. I think I would prefer a slight push for higher contrast and saturation to make it ''pop'' all that much more.</td>', 'Ah, an infamous subject! Great job on the execution and composition. I think I would prefer a slight push for higher contrast and saturation to make it ''pop'' all that much more.', '2020-04-29 21:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660780, 1248503, 96815, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro. I like the colours here.</td>', 'beautiful macro. I like the colours here.', '2020-04-29 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660782, 1248444, 96815, '<td valign="top">Wow, such great detail. I really like the contrast of light and dark, as well as the contrast of the warm-tone squizzel against the green grass back drop.</td>', 'Wow, such great detail. I really like the contrast of light and dark, as well as the contrast of the warm-tone squizzel against the green grass back drop.', '2020-04-29 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660783, 1248390, 96815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place and well captured. I think I would have backed off a little bit on the cool tone, but your take has a nice feel as well. For composition, setting the corner of the palace at 1/3rd would probably have a better balance. Based on the unbalanced vignetting, I wonder if the photo before-crop was closer to my ideal mark.</td>', 'Beautiful place and well captured. I think I would have backed off a little bit on the cool tone, but your take has a nice feel as well. For composition, setting the corner of the palace at 1/3rd would probably have a better balance. Based on the unbalanced vignetting, I wonder if the photo before-crop was closer to my ideal mark.', '2020-04-29 21:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660784, 1248504, 96815, '<td valign="top">It could be a fine art painting! Minor nitpick - I think the foreground could use a little more interest as the reflection gets lost in the ripples.</td>', 'It could be a fine art painting! Minor nitpick - I think the foreground could use a little more interest as the reflection gets lost in the ripples.', '2020-04-29 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660785, 1248327, 96815, '<td valign="top">A dreamy scene. Great colours and processing. I think it would have a little more impact to centre the land mass.</td>', 'A dreamy scene. Great colours and processing. I think it would have a little more impact to centre the land mass.', '2020-04-29 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7660787, 1248070, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a nice subject. The horizon straightness feels like a slight miss..although it could just be an illusion.</td>', 'Nice capture of a nice subject. The horizon straightness feels like a slight miss..although it could just be an illusion.', '2020-04-29 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
