(7661459, 1248624, 138630, '<td valign="top">Thanks much for the comments and votes.  Not quite square, Anita - 4:5 ratio.  I do actually have a square one.  I favor 2:3 or wider for landscape, too, but in this case the "stuff" on the left is regrettable and on the right it''s just empty field.  I tried and tried for a composition that felt balanced and was wider, but couldn''t find one.</td>', 'Thanks much for the comments and votes.  Not quite square, Anita - 4:5 ratio.  I do actually have a square one.  I favor 2:3 or wider for landscape, too, but in this case the "stuff" on the left is regrettable and on the right it''s just empty field.  I tried and tried for a composition that felt balanced and was wider, but couldn''t find one.', '2020-05-06 01:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
